{"kind": "mod", "id": 1550, "name": "INVENTORY ORGANIZING FEATURES", "slug": "inventory-organizing-features", "teaser": "Adds several inventory organizing features which rely on item tags, such as sort locking, move locking and container organizing. Also adds a button to take out all the items from a container.", "owner_name": "Meepowski", "downloads": 18524, "favourites": 0, "featured": false, "contains_ads": false, "contains_ai_content": false, "cheat_notice": false, "license_name": "University of Illinois/NCSA Open Source License", "guid": null, "thumbnail_local": null, "category": null, "category_id": null, "updated_at": "2026-07-13T18:04:24.000000Z", "created_at": "2024-07-12T08:37:30.000000Z", "published_at": "2024-07-12T08:37:30.000000Z", "latest_constraint": "~3.10.0", "latest_version": "1.0.3", "has_local": false, "has_github": false, "license_link": "https://choosealicense.com/licenses/ncsa/", "description_html": "<p><strong>THIS IS A QUICK FIX FOR THE MOD.<br />\nIF NIGHTINGALE OR ANY CONTRIBUTOR WANTS; I WILL TAKE IT DOWN NO QUESTIONS ASKED.</strong></p>\n<p><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/user/23286-nightingale/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">DeadLeaves</a> updated the original mod to 3.8.3.<br />\n<a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/user/56861-yume/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Yume</a> added recursive container sort.<br />\n<a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/user/59522-meepowski/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Meepowski</a> updated the mod to support 3.9.0.<a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/user/63839-kyomiko/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">KyoMiko</a> updated the mod to support 3.10.0.</p>\n<p>To install drop the .dll file into the \\BepInEx\\plugins folder.</p>\n<p>See full documentation and explanation of all the features here: <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/files/file/1152-inventory-organizing-features/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Inventory Organizing Features</a></p>\n<p>Remember to go there and thank <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/user/23286-nightingale/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Nightingale!  </a>They did all the hard work.</p>\n<p>Very little support will be provided. But if you get any errors, post them in the comments and I’ll see if there is anything that can be done.</p>\n", "versions": [{"version": "1.0.2", "spt_version_constraint": "3.10.0", "content_length": null, "downloads": 663, "published_at": "2024-12-18T08:30:29.000000Z", "forge_link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/1550/inventory-organizing-features/1.0.2", "github_url": null, "external_url": null, "local_path": null, "fika_compatibility": "unknown", "dependencies": []}, {"version": "1.0.3", "spt_version_constraint": "~3.10.0", "content_length": null, "downloads": 6102, "published_at": "2024-12-19T08:53:03.000000Z", "forge_link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/1550/inventory-organizing-features/1.0.3", "github_url": null, "external_url": null, "local_path": null, "fika_compatibility": "unknown", "dependencies": []}], "repos": ["Meepowski/SPT-InventoryOrganizingFeatures"], "source_code_links": [{"url": "https://github.com/Meepowski/SPT-InventoryOrganizingFeatures/tree/main", "label": ""}], "required_by": 0, "no_repo": false, "obtainable": true, "dep_problems": 0}